#: ../../examples/cancellation.rst:27
msgid "Use ``aclosing`` around a stream you might stop early. The example breaks on the first text delta, exits the context manager, and then reuses the client for a complete request:"
msgstr "对于可能提前停止的流，请用\\ ``aclosing``\\ 包起来。该示例在第一个文本增量处跳出，退出上下文管理器，然后复用客户端完成一次完整的请求："

#: ../../examples/cancellation.rst:35
msgid "If an extension retains request-local state, clean it on cancellation as well as success and error. ``WorkTracker`` demonstrates all three paths. Closing a stream does not roll back a tool action that already completed; design side-effecting tools with that distinction in mind."
msgstr "如果扩展保留了请求级状态，那么在取消时也要像成功和出错时一样清理它。\\ ``WorkTracker`` 演示了这三种路径。关闭流不会回滚已经完成的工具操作；设计有副作用的工具时请留意这一区别。"

